      <feedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Correct. This question is specific, researchable, and aligned to the unit topic.</p>]]></text></feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>C. Why do schools exist?</p>]]></text>
